    "claim": "A command-less control's commands tab is a dead end in the workbench: facetPresent(\"cmd\") is (record.cmd?.length > 0), so setFacet falls into the 'this control has no cmd facet - creating one is not wired up yet' branch and the new-command form never renders. The FIRST command on a fresh control cannot be created through the UI; seed it via dev.code.upsert_command, after which the tab works normally.",
    "detail": "Found 2026-08-14 while smoke-testing signature editing against scratch.scratch (zero commands). The form (.wb-newcmd) only renders inside the facet===\"cmd\" branch, which is unreachable while record.cmd is empty. Fix candidate: let the cmd chip through the absent gate in patch mode, like the html/css/js create-on-save affordance.",
